2025-12-25 17:40:27,794 | ExcelWriter | INFO | Here are the comprehensive manual test cases for the web application:

**Pre-login Scenarios**

TC_01|Blank URL|Open browser, enter https://rahulshettyacademy.com/loginpagePractise/ (no trailing slash)|Page not found error|
TC_02|Invalid URL|Enter https://invalidurl.com (random invalid URL)|Page not found error|
TC_03|No URL|Open browser without entering any URL|Default browser page or error message|

**UI Validation**

TC_04|Login Page UI|Verify login page title, header, and footer elements are present|Correct UI elements displayed|
TC_05|Form Fields|Verify username and password fields are present with correct labels|Fields and labels match expected|
TC_06|Submit Button|Verify submit button is present and enabled|Button is visible and clickable|

**Field Validations**

TC_07|Username Field|Enter invalid username (e.g., special characters)|Error message displayed for invalid username|
TC_08|Password Field|Enter password with less than 8 characters|Error message displayed for weak password|
TC_09|Username and Password|Enter valid username and password, then clear fields|Fields cleared successfully|

**Positive Login Flow**

TC_10|Valid Credentials|Enter valid username and password, submit form|Successful login, redirect to dashboard or expected page|
TC_11|Remember Me|Enable "Remember Me" option, log in, then close browser|Next time, auto-login with same credentials|

**Negative Login Scenarios**

TC_12|Invalid Username|Enter invalid username, valid password, and submit|Error message displayed for invalid username|
TC_13|Invalid Password|Enter valid username, invalid password, and submit|Error message displayed for invalid password|
TC_14|Blank Fields|Leave both fields blank and submit|Error messages displayed for missing credentials|

**Error Messages**

TC_15|Username Error|Enter invalid username and submit|Error message displayed for invalid username|
TC_16|Password Error|Enter valid username, invalid password, and submit|Error message displayed for invalid password|
TC_17|Blank Field Error|Leave both fields blank and submit|Error messages displayed for missing credentials|

**Navigation After Login**

TC_18|Dashboard Access|Log in successfully, verify dashboard or expected page is accessible|Correct page displayed after login|
TC_19|Menu Navigation|Verify menu options are available and functional after login|Menu items work as expected|

**Access Control (Unauthorized vs Authorized Access)**

TC_20|Unauthorized Access|Try to access restricted area without logging in|Access denied error message or redirect to login page|
TC_21|Authorized Access|Log in successfully, verify authorized access to restricted area|Correct page displayed with authorized access|

**Logout Behavior**

TC_22|Successful Logout|Log out successfully, verify logout confirmation message|Confirmation message displayed after logout|
TC_23|Failed Logout|Try to log out while not logged in|Error message displayed for failed logout attempt|

Please note that these test cases are just a starting point and may need to be modified or expanded based on the actual implementation of the web application.
